    - Masked paste: `paste(dst, patch, r0, c0, mask=m)`
    - Non-overwriting overlay: `paste(dst, patch, r0, c0, transparent=bg, overwrite=False)`
    - Strict vs clip: default `clip=False` (fail fast); set `clip=True` to clip out-of-bounds.
    """
